#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some sort of time synchronization facility on your system (like <xref "
"linkend=\"ntp\"/>) is required since Kerberos won't authenticate if there is"
" a time difference between a kerberized client and the KDC server."
msgstr ""
"Algum tipo de recurso de sincronização de tempo em seu sistema (como o <xref"
" linkend=\"ntp\"/>) é necessário, pois o Kerberos não autenticaria se "
"houvesse uma diferença de horário entre um cliente kerberizado e o servidor "
"KDC."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of MIT Kerberos V5"
msgstr "Instalação do MIT Kerberos V5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Build <application>MIT Kerberos V5</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Construa <application>MIT Kerberos V5</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#.  dejagnu is not used anymore for tests
#. sed -i -e 's@\^u}@^u cols 300}@' tests/dejagnu/config/default.exp
#. &amp;&amp;
#. sed -i '/t_kadm5.py/d'           lib/kadm5/Makefile.in
#. &amp;&amp;
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:127
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cd src &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -i -e '/eq 0/{N;s/12 //}'    plugins/kdb/db2/libdb2/test/run.test &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc        \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var/lib \\\n"
"            --runstatedir=/run       \\\n"
"            --with-system-et         \\\n"
"            --with-system-ss         \\\n"
"            --with-system-verto=no   \\\n"
"            --enable-dns-for-realm &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cd src &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -i -e '/eq 0/{N;s/12 //}'    plugins/kdb/db2/libdb2/test/run.test &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc        \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var/lib \\\n"
"            --runstatedir=/run       \\\n"
"            --with-system-et         \\\n"
"            --with-system-ss         \\\n"
"            --with-system-verto=no   \\\n"
"            --enable-dns-for-realm &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#.  You need at least <xref link end="tcl"/>
#. , which is used to drive the
#.       test suite.  Furthermore, <xref link end="dejagnu"/> must be
#. available for
#.       some of the tests to run. If you have a former version of MIT
#. Kerberos V5
#.       installed, it may happen that the test suite may pick up the
#. installed
#.       versions of the libraries, rather than the newly built ones. If so,
#. it is
#.       better to run the tests after the installation.
#.  Note: on my laptop -j8 fails but -j1 passes
#.       For version 1.21, -j1 no longer needs to be specified and the
#.       time for the tests was reduced considerably.  -bdubbs
#.       But on one of my machines (4 cores) -j4 fails and -j1 passes...
#.       I guess the test suite is just too fragile. -xry111
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:145
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the build, issue: <command>make -j1 -k check</command>.  Some tests "
"may fail with the latest version of dejagnu and glibc.  Some tests may hang "
"for a long time and fail if the system is not connected to a network.  One "
"test, <filename>t_kadm5srv</filename>, is known to fail."
msgstr ""
"Para testar a construção, emita: <command>make -j1 -k check</command>. "
"Alguns testes possivelmente falhem com a versão mais recente de dejagnu e "
"glibc. Alguns testes possivelmente travem por um tempo longo e falhem se o "
"sistema não estiver conectado a uma rede de comunicação. Um teste, "
"<filename>t_kadm5srv</filename>, é conhecido por falhar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:167
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -vfr ../doc -T /usr/share/doc/krb5-&mitkrb-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -vfr ../doc -T /usr/share/doc/krb5-&mitkrb-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:173
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Still as the &root; user, remove linker flags setting RPATH from the "
"<command>krb5-config</command> script.  These flags are unneeded for an "
"installation in the standard prefix (<filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename>) and they may cause some packages fail to "
"build:"
msgstr ""
"Ainda como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, remova os sinalizadores do vinculador "
"configurando RPATH do script <command>krb5-config</command>. Esses "
"sinalizadores são desnecessários para uma instalação no prefixo padrão "
"(<filename class='directory'>/usr</filename>) e podem causar alguns pacotes "
"falharem para construir:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:180
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed '/PROG_RPATH_FLAGS/d' -i /usr/bin/krb5-config</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed '/PROG_RPATH_FLAGS/d' -i /usr/bin/krb5-config</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:185
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:188
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <command>sed</command> command removes a test that is known to fail."
msgstr ""
"O comando <command>sed</command> remove um teste que é conhecido por falhar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:193
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--localstatedir=/var/lib</parameter>: This option is used so that"
" the Kerberos variable runtime data is located in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/lib</filename> instead of <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/var</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--localstatedir=/var/lib</parameter>: Essa opção é usada de forma"
" que os dados variáveis de tempo de execução do Kerberos estejam localizados"
" em <filename class=\"directory\">/var/lib</filename> em vez de <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/var</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:200
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--runstatedir=/run</parameter>: This option is used so that the "
"Kerberos runtime state information is located in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/run</filename> instead of the deprecated <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/run</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--runstatedir=/run</parameter>: Essa opção é usada de forma que a"
" informação de estado em tempo de execução do Kerberos esteja localizada em "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/run</filename> em vez do obsoleto <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/run</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:207
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-system-et</parameter>: This switch causes the build to use"
" the system-installed versions of the error-table support software."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-system-et</parameter>: Essa chave faz com que a construção"
" use as versões instaladas do sistema do software de suporte à tabela de "
"erros."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:213
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-system-ss</parameter>: This switch causes the build to use"
" the system-installed versions of the subsystem command-line interface "
"software."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-system-ss</parameter>: Essa chave faz com que a construção"
" use as versões instaladas do sistema do software de interface de linha de "
"comando do subsistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:219
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-system-verto=no</parameter>: This switch fixes a bug in "
"the package: it does not recognize its own verto library installed "
"previously. This is not a problem, if reinstalling the same version, but if "
"you are updating, the old library is used as system's one, instead of "
"installing the new version."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-system-verto=no</parameter>: Essa chave corrige um defeito"
" no pacote: ele não reconhece a própria biblioteca verto dele instalada "
"anteriormente. Isso não é um problema, se reinstalar-se a mesma versão; mas,"
" se estiver atualizando, [então] a biblioteca antiga é usada como a do "
"sistema, ao invés de instalar a nova versão."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:227
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-dns-for-realm</parameter>: This switch allows realms to "
"be resolved using the DNS server."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-dns-for-realm</parameter>: Essa chave permite que os "
"domínios sejam resolvidos usando o servidor DNS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/mitkrb.xml:232
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-ldap</option>: Use this switch if you want to compile the "
"<application>OpenLDAP</application> database backend module."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-ldap</option>: Use essa chave se desejar compilar o módulo de"
" estrutura de retaguarda da base de dados "
"<application>OpenLDAP</application>."

